(5943097, 866442, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a funny concept you have chosen. I am not a food photo expert though I think the food looks a little too moist to make me think it is delicious. I am not sure if you were going for something that looked like you would want to eat it or something that is kind of gross... What makes it look unappetizing is the moisture of the food and the harsh lighting. It could be a little overly sharpened. Anyway, it is a fun shot and something that I enjoyed voting on.</td>', 'This is a funny concept you have chosen. I am not a food photo expert though I think the food looks a little too moist to make me think it is delicious. I am not sure if you were going for something that looked like you would want to eat it or something that is kind of gross... What makes it look unappetizing is the moisture of the food and the harsh lighting. It could be a little overly sharpened. Anyway, it is a fun shot and something that I enjoyed voting on.', '2010-04-12 21:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
