(5943116, 866017, 10785, '<td valign="top">The color of the cheese puff stands out nicely against the blue/grey background. However it is not a very interesting shot. It reminds me of when I was in high school photography class and I had free black and white film I would go out and shoot cigarette butts on the ground. I never got good grades from those photos... barely above a D. Why did I do that?? Because I was''t very creative and the subjects were readily available.</td>', 'The color of the cheese puff stands out nicely against the blue/grey background. However it is not a very interesting shot. It reminds me of when I was in high school photography class and I had free black and white film I would go out and shoot cigarette butts on the ground. I never got good grades from those photos... barely above a D. Why did I do that?? Because I was''t very creative and the subjects were readily available.', '2010-04-12 21:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943125, 867065, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good Black and white conversion here, or is it inverted?? No real compositional technique used except for mayb close up shot. It''s funny though and illustrates a great email chain letter nicely.</td>', 'Good Black and white conversion here, or is it inverted?? No real compositional technique used except for mayb close up shot. It''s funny though and illustrates a great email chain letter nicely.', '2010-04-12 21:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943133, 867050, 10785, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice landscape.  think the subject of the photo is the kayak in the creek and it appears to be waaay to far away. There isn''t really anything to make this stand out as being above average. You did get a good leading line with the stream at the diagonal and the sky in the top third of the photo.</td>', 'Pretty nice landscape.  think the subject of the photo is the kayak in the creek and it appears to be waaay to far away. There isn''t really anything to make this stand out as being above average. You did get a good leading line with the stream at the diagonal and the sky in the top third of the photo.', '2010-04-12 21:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943137, 866839, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good vacation shot for the family album. You got good color here. The lighting is pretty harsh and puts the models face half in shadow half in bright direct sunlight giving her a squinty look which is not really good technique for portrait photos. There is good humor with the I heart NB shirt. Is it New Brunswick or Nebraska or something?</td>', 'This is a good vacation shot for the family album. You got good color here. The lighting is pretty harsh and puts the models face half in shadow half in bright direct sunlight giving her a squinty look which is not really good technique for portrait photos. There is good humor with the I heart NB shirt. Is it New Brunswick or Nebraska or something?', '2010-04-12 21:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943139, 866946, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good color. I''d like to see sharper detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Good color. I''d like to see sharper detail in the feathers.', '2010-04-12 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943146, 866798, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think there is a little too much clutter in the photo. Nothing stands out as it all blends in together.</td>', 'I think there is a little too much clutter in the photo. Nothing stands out as it all blends in together.', '2010-04-12 21:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943149, 866962, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would pump up the contrast a bit to get rid of the greyish look to this. The small sun flare doesn''t add anything to the shot as it is not leading you in to the subject or anything like that.</td>', 'I would pump up the contrast a bit to get rid of the greyish look to this. The small sun flare doesn''t add anything to the shot as it is not leading you in to the subject or anything like that.', '2010-04-12 21:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943154, 866812, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural light here. I would maybe try to get in a little closer. It looks like you have tried to show too much here for context that is not needed.</td>', 'Good use of natural light here. I would maybe try to get in a little closer. It looks like you have tried to show too much here for context that is not needed.', '2010-04-12 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943158, 866033, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repetition and varied size of object to creat a rhythm. Color is good. Background needs something to help this stand out as the small can is lost in the product box in the background.</td>', 'Nice use of repetition and varied size of object to creat a rhythm. Color is good. Background needs something to help this stand out as the small can is lost in the product box in the background.', '2010-04-12 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
