(5943400, 866421, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a great photo. I''m dying to find out how you achieved this. If I could offer a slight critisms (and I mean slight) there is a bit of a halo around the hand face that may have been worth removing after achieving such a wonderful and impressive shot. Well done!</td>', 'Wow! What a great photo. I''m dying to find out how you achieved this. If I could offer a slight critisms (and I mean slight) there is a bit of a halo around the hand face that may have been worth removing after achieving such a wonderful and impressive shot. Well done!', '2010-04-12 23:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943403, 865730, 75034, '<td valign="top">I think your thinking outside the box is great on this shot. You have everything tack sharp and a good composition. <br/> <br/>MAX!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-15 09:21:28.</i></td>', 'I think your thinking outside the box is great on this shot. You have everything tack sharp and a good composition.  MAX!', '2010-04-12 23:22:50.000000', '2010-05-15 10:21:28.000000', 1),
(5943409, 866414, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo! Unfortunately, I don''t think it really meets the challenge very much (or at least not as well as many other images). I wish this was in a Free Study, then I could judge this even higher. 6</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo! Unfortunately, I don''t think it really meets the challenge very much (or at least not as well as many other images). I wish this was in a Free Study, then I could judge this even higher. 6', '2010-04-12 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943410, 866950, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is great! PLEASE explain how you achieved this. Even the folds in the shirt almost align perfectly. Great title too. I''m mesmorised every time I look at this photo. Well done.</td>', 'This is great! PLEASE explain how you achieved this. Even the folds in the shirt almost align perfectly. Great title too. I''m mesmorised every time I look at this photo. Well done.', '2010-04-12 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943418, 866965, 40391, '<td valign="top">Simple but very clever! I''m not sure if this has been done before but I''ve never seen it and you''ve capture it exremely well.  I love the clarity and colours. Did the glass eventually break from the heat or did the flame run out of oxygen? I''m not sure if you could have prevented the reflection (shirt with writing?) but it doesn''t take away from the photo as far as I''m concerned. Well done.</td>', 'Simple but very clever! I''m not sure if this has been done before but I''ve never seen it and you''ve capture it exremely well.  I love the clarity and colours. Did the glass eventually break from the heat or did the flame run out of oxygen? I''m not sure if you could have prevented the reflection (shirt with writing?) but it doesn''t take away from the photo as far as I''m concerned. Well done.', '2010-04-12 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943423, 867049, 40391, '<td valign="top">A little disturbing... but I love it! Great model, great prop, great location and great capture. What can I say but GREAT photo!</td>', 'A little disturbing... but I love it! Great model, great prop, great location and great capture. What can I say but GREAT photo!', '2010-04-12 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943435, 866999, 40391, '<td valign="top">When this first started loading on my slow laptop and all I got was the top portion I thought ''ho hum - another volcano shot'' (lots lately). By the time I got the whole picture I was blown away! I sure hope that guy wasn''t photographing someone even closer!  The colours, movement and subject are perfectly captured.  You should sell this to National Geographic. Your title is great and this is truely Out of the Ordinary. Well done!</td>', 'When this first started loading on my slow laptop and all I got was the top portion I thought ''ho hum - another volcano shot'' (lots lately). By the time I got the whole picture I was blown away! I sure hope that guy wasn''t photographing someone even closer!  The colours, movement and subject are perfectly captured.  You should sell this to National Geographic. Your title is great and this is truely Out of the Ordinary. Well done!', '2010-04-12 23:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943440, 866905, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very clever and well captured!  I''m hoping this is on the back of a flatbed truck or something as the rider would have some mad blind-spots.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very clever and well captured!  I''m hoping this is on the back of a flatbed truck or something as the rider would have some mad blind-spots.  Good luck.', '2010-04-12 23:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
