(5943553, 866442, 115345, '<td valign="top">good colours and focus and imagination but it just doesn''t hit me.  It should!- the idea (I am guessing) based on the subject matter and arrangement is to provoke a response from the viewer but for some reason isn''t doing that for me.  I am wondering if it is a little to unsubtle... perhaps if you had panned back a bit so the shot at first glance looks like a fairly normal scene then forces a second glance to make the hit rather than the screws being pretty much in your face?  Who knows... sorry but had to give it 5</td>', 'good colours and focus and imagination but it just doesn''t hit me.  It should!- the idea (I am guessing) based on the subject matter and arrangement is to provoke a response from the viewer but for some reason isn''t doing that for me.  I am wondering if it is a little to unsubtle... perhaps if you had panned back a bit so the shot at first glance looks like a fairly normal scene then forces a second glance to make the hit rather than the screws being pretty much in your face?  Who knows... sorry but had to give it 5', '2010-04-13 01:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943556, 866003, 115345, '<td valign="top">good focus and colours but it doesn''t really grab me.  Maybe a tighter crop perhaps or more dramatic lighting?  Not sure but can''t see how to make this shot stand out but for me it just doesn''t resonate - 5</td>', 'good focus and colours but it doesn''t really grab me.  Maybe a tighter crop perhaps or more dramatic lighting?  Not sure but can''t see how to make this shot stand out but for me it just doesn''t resonate - 5', '2010-04-13 01:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943562, 867086, 115345, '<td valign="top">I think this has potential but wondering if the interesting bits (for me the top half of the image) wouldn''t have been better if made more dominant.<br/> <br/>The bottom half takes up a lot of image and the composition seems to aim the eye there but isn''t that interesting - sorry had to give it 5 but personally think it could have been worth much more with a different angle of shot and cropping.  Potential is there.</td>', 'I think this has potential but wondering if the interesting bits (for me the top half of the image) wouldn''t have been better if made more dominant. The bottom half takes up a lot of image and the composition seems to aim the eye there but isn''t that interesting - sorry had to give it 5 but personally think it could have been worth much more with a different angle of shot and cropping.  Potential is there.', '2010-04-13 01:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5943623, 866442, 25355, '<td valign="top">A bit of overkill here, and not a good presentation. However, the band-aid <i>was</i> a good idea and I think you could have developed that better.</td>', 'A bit of overkill here, and not a good presentation. However, the band-aid was a good idea and I think you could have developed that better.', '2010-04-13 02:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
