(5946653, 866906, 81042, '<td valign="top">This picture has a ton of potential. There are a few changes I might try for effect. For instance a tighter square crop, cutting out most of the shoulder, the beer can and the much of the table cloth. The chocolate drip is perfectly in line and looks completely natural. The glare on the bottom of the magazine is slightly bothersome. Well done. 6</td>', 'This picture has a ton of potential. There are a few changes I might try for effect. For instance a tighter square crop, cutting out most of the shoulder, the beer can and the much of the table cloth. The chocolate drip is perfectly in line and looks completely natural. The glare on the bottom of the magazine is slightly bothersome. Well done. 6', '2010-04-14 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
