(5948123, 867086, 83313, '<td valign="top">How am I to run over him way up there? A good enough shot, though I think you could have perhaps done something to crank up the wow factor. Lots of great rusty crusty detail in this one that would have responded well to just a small amount of Topaz, clarify, or some other variety of tonemapping.</td>', 'How am I to run over him way up there? A good enough shot, though I think you could have perhaps done something to crank up the wow factor. Lots of great rusty crusty detail in this one that would have responded well to just a small amount of Topaz, clarify, or some other variety of tonemapping.', '2010-04-15 14:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
